@startuml Welcome & Onboarding Flow (Hybrid)
!theme plain
title LedgerGuard – Hybrid Welcome & Onboarding Flow

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

|#E8F0FE|Firebase|
|#FFF3E0|Backend|
|#E8F5E9|n8n / Custom Webhook|
|#F3E5F5|Postmark|
|#E0F7FA|Flutter App|

' === SIGNUP TRIGGER ===

|Firebase|
start
:User signs up\n(Email/Password or Google);

|Backend|
:Auth Middleware\nverifies Firebase token;
if (User exists in DB?) then (yes)
  :Load existing user;
else (no)
  :Create new user\n(role=OWNER, plan=FREE,\nonboarding_completed_at=NULL);
  :Fire **user.created** event;

  |n8n / Custom Webhook|
  fork
    :POST webhook URL\n(HMAC-SHA256 signed);
    note right
      Configurable destination:
      - n8n (default, self-hosted)
      - Customer.io
      - Brevo / ActiveCampaign
      - Any custom endpoint
    end note

    |Postmark|
    :Send **Welcome Email**\n"Welcome to LedgerGuard!";
    :Wait 24 hours;

    |n8n / Custom Webhook|
    if (connect_partner\ncompleted?) then (yes)
      :Skip email;
    else (no)
      |Postmark|
      :Send **Connect Shopify**\nemail (Day 1);
    endif

    |n8n / Custom Webhook|
    :Wait 48 hours;
    if (view_dashboard\ncompleted?) then (yes)
      :Skip email;
    else (no)
      |Postmark|
      :Send **Explore Dashboard**\nemail (Day 3);
    endif

    |n8n / Custom Webhook|
    :Wait 4 days;
    if (try_ai_chat\ncompleted?) then (yes)
      :Skip email;
    else (no)
      |Postmark|
      :Send **Try AI Chat**\nemail (Day 7);
    endif

  fork again

    ' === IN-APP CHECKLIST ===

    |Flutter App|
    :User lands on Dashboard;
    :GET /api/v1/users/\nonboarding-status;

    |Backend|
    :Return onboarding status\n{is_complete, next_step,\nhas_partner, has_apps};

    |Flutter App|
    :Show **Onboarding\nChecklist Banner**;
    note right
      Checklist Steps:
      [x] Sign up
      [ ] Connect Shopify Partner
      [ ] Select an App
      [ ] View Dashboard Metrics
      [ ] Try AI Chat
    end note

    :User completes step;
    :POST /api/v1/users/\nonboarding-step;

    |Backend|
    :Record step completion;
    :Fire **onboarding.step_completed**\nevent -> webhook;

    |Flutter App|
    :Update checklist UI\n(animate checkmark);

    if (All steps\ncomplete?) then (yes)
      :POST /api/v1/users/\nonboarding-complete;

      |Backend|
      :Set onboarding_completed_at\n= NOW();
      :Fire **onboarding.completed**\nevent -> webhook;

      |n8n / Custom Webhook|
      :Cancel remaining drip;

      |Postmark|
      :Send **You're All Set!**\ncelebration email;

      |Flutter App|
      :Hide checklist\nShow success message;
    else (no)
      :Continue showing checklist;
    endif

  end fork
endif

|Flutter App|
:Dashboard with\nfull functionality;
stop

' === NOTES ===

note bottom
  **Webhook Security:**
  - HMAC-SHA256 signature (X-LedgerGuard-Signature)
  - Timestamp header (X-LedgerGuard-Timestamp)
  - Idempotency key (X-LedgerGuard-Idempotency-Key)
  - Retry: 3 attempts (1s, 5s, 30s backoff)

  **Configuration:**
  WELCOME_WEBHOOK_URL (env var or admin setting)
  WELCOME_WEBHOOK_SECRET (HMAC signing key)
end note

@enduml
